{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>38歲前TVB「咪神」白雲自上月初認愛22歲德國籍鮮肉機師後，二人於昨日（11月3日）高調飛往毛里裘斯度假瘋狂 …</p><p></p>\n<p>38歲前TVB「咪神」白雲自上月初認愛22歲德國籍鮮肉機師後，二人於昨日（11月3日）高調飛往毛里裘斯度假瘋狂放閃。期間她突然在社交平台宣佈即將開設付費訂閱直播，憑其過往火辣形象瞬間引發大批網民無限遐想。不過當付費專區真實內容曝光後，一眾以為有大尺度福利睇粉絲頓時大跌眼鏡。</p>\n<h2>白雲偕22歲機師男友同遊毛里裘斯</h2>\n<p>白雲與男友飛抵毛里裘斯展開甜蜜假期，行程相當豐富且充滿視覺震撼。二人換上純白情侶泳裝乘坐遊艇出海享受日光浴，更一同潛入深海與巨型抹香鯨近距離同框暢泳，畫面唯美壯觀。回到陸上後他們乘坐吉普車穿梭叢林探訪野生獅子，在夕陽映照沙灘上上演浪漫「公主抱」，白雲全程緊緊依偎在身形高大男友身旁，舉手投足間充滿熱戀中甜蜜氣息。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547452823886_19423765306aeab0632e46f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793528771_4020731471159982008_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547452823886_19423765306aeab0632e46f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>付費直播真相曝光白雲親自解畫</h2>\n<p>面對大批粉絲誤以為即將有性感解鎖環節，白雲迅速在社交平台發文揭開謎底。她上載多張與男友合照並親自寫道：「下次訂閱直播 subscribe live 講我們相識的過程🤗」。原來該付費專區並非如外界猜測般主打火辣福利，而是準備大談這段跨國姊弟戀相識經過與甜蜜點滴。她更特意為機師男友開設全新專屬社交帳號，互相標籤以帶動熱度，將這段戀情熱度轉化為流量密碼。</p>\n<h2>白雲揮別5年婚姻勇敢高調認愛</h2>\n<p>回顧感情狀況，白雲於2021年正式結束維持5年婚姻關係，沉寂一時後終於迎來第二春。她於上月初震撼娛樂圈，大方公開與2004年出生德國籍機師相戀消息。雖然這段異國姊弟戀橫跨16年年齡鴻溝，同時需要克服語言及文化差異，但二人感情依然迅速升溫。白雲曾公開大讚這位年輕小鮮肉思想極度成熟可靠，讓她能夠毫無包袱地做最真實自己，完全沉浸在全新戀愛生活之中。</p>\n<h2>網民錯失性感福利直呼中伏爆笑</h2>\n<p>付費訂閱真實用途公開後，網絡上隨即引發熱烈討論。不少原本滿心期待老司機驚覺表錯情，紛紛留言笑指：「以為係咪神福利，點知係純愛放閃台」、「課金去睇你哋放閃，呢波操作太絕！」對於這段充滿話題性戀情，部分酸民曾留下露骨性騷擾及質疑言論，白雲一律採取冷處理態度應對。她選擇不作任何正面交鋒，繼續專注經營自己網上平台及分享旅行生活點滴。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547770329998_10472423386aeab065ebb91.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793356408_4019278659834325000_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376547770329998_10472423386aeab065ebb91.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548064954806_14647763546aeab0690693c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793356408_4019278658139638968_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548064954806_14647763546aeab0690693c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937654824986811_2567869486aeab06ae7a83.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793269172_4018551364777526360_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937654824986811_2567869486aeab06ae7a83.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548675875584_86082146aeab06f1335d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793269172_4018551374785184081_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548675875584_86082146aeab06f1335d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548938448898_4140455686aeab071a7522.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793528771_4020731477308784039_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376548938448898_4140455686aeab071a7522.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376549216893064_3263535056aeab07469876.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"snowybai_1793528771_4020731463761146393_283568577.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376549216893064_3263535056aeab07469876.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179154280187783486_2118822426ac8c61264105.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"白雲 異國戀 （圖片來源：IG@snowybai）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179154280187783486_2118822426ac8c61264105.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bb%98%e8%b2%bb%e7%9b%b4%e6%92%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">付費直播</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a7%8a%e5%bc%9f%e6%88%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">姊弟戀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%99%bd%e9%9b%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">白雲</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535601\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:46:10.790907+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1389,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:11:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:19:11.096647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:39:08.820553+00:00","content_hash":"595aa842e25034658ad6915129a07b69e164777abc5a683e8585cc9f04aa0244","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}